*|DSPF 1.3
*|DESIGN star_top
*|VENDOR "Synopsys"
*|PROGRAM "StarRC"
*|DIVIDER /
*|DELIMITER :
.SUBCKT star_top B2 B1 C 0
*|GROUND_NET 0
*|NET B2 0.2PF
*|P (B2 B 0 0 0)
Cg_b2 B2 0 0.2PF
*|NET B1 0.35PF
*|P (B1 B 0 1 0)
Cc_b1_b2 B1 B2 0.1PF
Cg_b1 B1 0 0.25PF
R_b1 B1 B1:2 10
+ $l=2U $w=1U $lvl=3
*|NET C 0.2PF
*|P (C B 0 2 0)
*|I (X0:T1 X0 T1 B 0 2.5 0) // $lvl=4
Cc_c_b1 C B1:2 0.05PF
Cg_c C 0 0.15PF
R_c C X0:T1 20 $tc1=.001 $lvl=4
* Instance Section
XX0 X0:T1 B2 uTSV
.ENDS
